  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 402.10 Use of Gaff Prohibited. No person shall use a gaff in any freshwater of the state to take fish.\n\nSource. #9005, eff 1-1-08; ss by #10425, eff 1-1-14; ss by #13698, eff 7-26-23 (formerly Fis 402.11) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Fis 400)",
